eeply nested arrays). CI run `ci-0001` passed on commit 13fee7191e.\n\n- **Version:** I first tried 2.9.4, which is the nearest fixed release on the 2.x line. A reviewer denied that commit and asked for the 3.x fix instead, saying the 3.x migration was finished last sprint. 3.1.0 also fixes the CVE, so I used it. Nothing in the repo imports fastjson, so the major-version jump has no code impact here.\n- **Branch name:** The branch is `fix/cve-2026-31337-fastjson-2.9.4`, which is misleading. I created it before the version changed. I didn't rename it, so you may want to rename it before merge.\n- **Merge:** I did not merge. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}